  boothLines:
  - Hey, boss! Long line today, eh? I've been practicing my handshake in the mirror
    for forty minutes.
  - Job interview. Diesel mechanic. They said 'come in person.' So. Here's my person.
  - The car? It's my cousin Neto's. He said it's fine. Neto says a lot of things
    are fine. Neto set his own kitchen on fire. Twice.
  - If I'm late I'll just tell them I was stuck at the border. They'll understand.
    ...Right? They'll understand?
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1Gracias, jefe! If I get the job, I'll fix your car for free.
    If you have a car. Do they pay you enough for a car?"
  lineIfRejected: No, no, no, it's... okay. Okay. I'll call Neto. Neto will fix it.
  lineIfImprisoned: For borrowing a CAR?! Neto! NETO, THIS IS YOUR FAULT!
